            "detailed_description": "<h1>Características</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frantic Twin-Stick Shooting</strong>: Take on waves of enemies with fast-paced, arcade-style dual-stick combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tag-Team Gameplay</strong>: Swap between the Gamma Brothers mid-battle to stay alive and keep the fight going. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Arcade Challenge</strong>: Skill-based gameplay inspired by old-school shooters—easy to pick up, tough to master. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups &amp; Progression</strong>: Collect upgrades and adapt to increasingly intense enemy waves. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong>: Supports fullscreen, controllers, and 8-directional firing. </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gamma Brothers spend their days working hard aboard a massive space station near Jupiter. What are they building? Something very important, probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/a7e30883ed67bcdebf45a7a7b3f19ff6.poster.avif?t=1791219472\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/a7e30883ed67bcdebf45a7a7b3f19ff6.webm?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/a7e30883ed67bcdebf45a7a7b3f19ff6.mp4?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gamma Brothers also understand the importance of not working.  Every day at quitting time they hop into their commuter vehicles for the long, difficult journey back to earth.  Every day on their way home, they are attacked by ships and creatures of unknown origin. Swarms of alien vessels, bizarre creatures, and relentless attacks stand between them and getting home for dinner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/633bdbde813840e0c21662be83203c04.poster.avif?t=1791219472\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/633bdbde813840e0c21662be83203c04.webm?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/633bdbde813840e0c21662be83203c04.mp4?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamma Bros is a fast and frantic arcade experience inspired by classic twin-stick shooters. Blast through waves of enemies and switch between brothers on the fly to keep your run alive! Whether you're chasing high scores, reliving the feel of classic arcade shooters, or just looking for a quick burst of action, Gamma Bros keeps things simple, challenging, and fun. After all, their family is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/8dbd7754323190e64813a3afb0e4cd90.poster.avif?t=1791219472\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/8dbd7754323190e64813a3afb0e4cd90.webm?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/8dbd7754323190e64813a3afb0e4cd90.mp4?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gamma Brothers spend their days working hard aboard a massive space station near Jupiter. What are they building? Something very important, probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/a7e30883ed67bcdebf45a7a7b3f19ff6.poster.avif?t=1791219472\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/a7e30883ed67bcdebf45a7a7b3f19ff6.webm?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/a7e30883ed67bcdebf45a7a7b3f19ff6.mp4?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gamma Brothers also understand the importance of not working.  Every day at quitting time they hop into their commuter vehicles for the long, difficult journey back to earth.  Every day on their way home, they are attacked by ships and creatures of unknown origin. Swarms of alien vessels, bizarre creatures, and relentless attacks stand between them and getting home for dinner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/633bdbde813840e0c21662be83203c04.poster.avif?t=1791219472\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/633bdbde813840e0c21662be83203c04.webm?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/633bdbde813840e0c21662be83203c04.mp4?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamma Bros is a fast and frantic arcade experience inspired by classic twin-stick shooters. Blast through waves of enemies and switch between brothers on the fly to keep your run alive! Whether you're chasing high scores, reliving the feel of classic arcade shooters, or just looking for a quick burst of action, Gamma Bros keeps things simple, challenging, and fun. After all, their family is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/8dbd7754323190e64813a3afb0e4cd90.poster.avif?t=1791219472\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/8dbd7754323190e64813a3afb0e4cd90.webm?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436470/extras/8dbd7754323190e64813a3afb0e4cd90.mp4?t=1791219472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
